{
  "name": "day_plan_single",
  "agents": ["day_plan_single_agent"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "name": "plan_day_single_task",
      "description": "In ONE shot: research, compose, and self-review a DayPlan for day {day_index} on {date} in {overnight_city}, then emit DayPlanWithQuality.\n\nContext:\n- overnight_city: {overnight_city}\n- day_index: {day_index}\n- date: {date}\n- origin: {origin}\n- destination: {destination} (destination_type={destination_type})\n- preferences: {preferences}\n- include_breakfast: {include_breakfast}\n- food_crawl_mode: {food_crawl_mode} (min_non_food_places={min_non_food_places}; day_shape_hint={day_shape_hint})\n- interests: {interests}\n- energy_level: {energy_level} (max comfortable day minutes including travel: {max_comfortable_minutes}; target_place_count={target_place_count})\n- already_visited (do NOT recommend these place_keys or obvious duplicates): {already_visited}\n- prior_days_summary: {prior_days_summary}\n- city_route_json (confirmed route; overnight_city must match): {city_route_json}\n\nTools:\n- Prefer Amap Place Search when destination/overnight is mainland China; otherwise use web search.\n- Gather real venue names with street-level addresses, maps URLs, operational_status, closed_weekdays when known.\n\nHard requirements for day_plan (schema rejects otherwise):\n- overnight_city exact, day_index={day_index}, date={date}\n- 3–7 places aiming for target_place_count={target_place_count}\n- category for EVERY place is EXACTLY one of these lowercase strings only:\n  museum | food | park | transit | lodging | nightlife | shopping | nature | other\n  Forbidden examples (do not emit): temple, shrine, cafe, restaurant, attraction, landmark, activity, cultural, market, viewpoint — remap (temple/shrine→other or museum; cafe/restaurant→food; garden→park or nature; shop→shopping).\n- Lunch AND dinner as TWO distinct Places with category=food (not one food stop). reason_to_visit must start with \"Lunch —\" and \"Dinner —\". Schema requires ≥2 food places.\n- If include_breakfast=true, also add a named breakfast venue as category=food with \"Breakfast —\".\n- When food_crawl_mode=false, ≥{min_non_food_places} non-food Place — never food-only\n- POI-only (no neighborhoods/wards as stops)\n- Respect energy cap {max_comfortable_minutes}; when trimming, drop extras before meals or the last non-food stop\n- Do not reuse already_visited\n\nQualityReport:\n- relevance_score and constraint_score 1–5\n- failure_tags from the standard set (preference_mismatch, excluded_category, duplicate_place, wrong_city, closed_place, missing_meals, food_only_day, energy_overload, …)\n- passes_relevance=false only for objective hard failures\n\nOutput DayPlanWithQuality only (day_plan + quality). No Markdown essay.",
      "expected_output": "DayPlanWithQuality: final day_plan (~{target_place_count} POIs within 3–7; every category in {museum,food,park,transit,lodging,nightlife,shopping,nature,other}; ≥2 category=food meals lunch+dinner; day balance) and quality {passes_relevance, relevance_score, constraint_score, failure_tags, notes}.",
      "agent": "day_plan_single_agent",
      "output_pydantic": { "python": "day_models.DayPlanWithQuality" }
    }
  ],
  "process": "sequential",
  "verbose": false,
  "memory": false,
  "output_log_file": "logs/crew.log",
  "stream": false,
  "tracing": false,
  "inputs": {
    "origin": "San Francisco",
    "destination": "Japan",
    "destination_type": "country",
    "day_index": "1",
    "date": "2026-09-01",
    "overnight_city": "Tokyo",
    "preferences": "culture, food, moderate pace",
    "include_breakfast": "false",
    "food_crawl_mode": "false",
    "min_non_food_places": "1",
    "day_shape_hint": "food_activity_activity_activity_food",
    "interests": "temples, food",
    "energy_level": "3",
    "max_comfortable_minutes": "510",
    "target_place_count": "5",
    "already_visited": "",
    "prior_days_summary": "",
    "city_route_json": ""
  }
}
